# mentorOS — i18n Rules

---

## Core rules (all modules)

- **NEVER** hardcode Vietnamese or English strings in JSX for **new** UI work.
- ALL visible UI text must come from `src/lib/i18n/vi.ts` or `src/lib/i18n/en.ts`.
- Use `useLanguage()` hook and `t()` accessor in every Client Component that renders text.
- When adding a new UI string: add it to **BOTH** `vi.ts` and `en.ts` at the same time.
- i18n keys use **snake_case**, nested by section: `nav.home`, `home.hero_title`, `products.pmp.tagline`

